# Community apps

These apps run on servers, so they need an internet connection. Each is its own site on a `radii-office.com` address!

## Phosphor

{badge Messaging | green | soft} [phosphor.radii-office.com](https://phosphor.radii-office.com)

A Discord-style chat. Make an account and you can:

* Create **servers** with **channels**, **roles** and permissions!
* Send **direct messages** and make **group chats**, and add **friends**!
* Use **custom emojis**, reactions, pins, threads and polls!
* Join **voice channels** (up to 8 people)!
* Add **webhooks**, and use slash commands like `/me`, `/shrug`, `/poll` and `/nick`!
* Jump anywhere with the **quick switcher** (Ctrl+K)!

Messages are written in Keydown!

## Antimony

{badge Boards | pink | soft} [Open Antimony](/antimony)

A free message board. Make spaces, post and reply, and watch new messages appear as they arrive!

## Beta

{badge Microblog | lime | soft} [beta.radii-office.com](https://beta.radii-office.com)

Short posts with `#topics`. You can follow people, like, reply, run polls, make lists, keep drafts and collections, set reminders and ask questions. **Outlets** are rooms for group talk, and there is a **Friends** feature. Each Beta instance picks its own usernames!

## Mintcode

{badge Code hosting | teal | soft} [mintcode.radii-office.com](https://mintcode.radii-office.com)

Host code with **Mint**, a simple saves-and-lines version tool. It has repositories, stars, forks, issues and a web editor!

## Overshare

{badge Sharing | purple | soft} [overshare.radii-office.com](https://overshare.radii-office.com)

Share documents and work on them together. Read more in [Sharing](#/sharing)!

## Keydown in the community apps

Phosphor, Beta, Mintcode and Antimony all draw Keydown in messages and posts. Their copy of Keydown is cleaned a second time after it is drawn, so scripts and frames can't get through!
